flowchart TB
  accTitle: SwiGLU branches and channel dimensions
  accDescr: x branches to a C-to-M gate projection followed by SiLU and a separate C-to-M up projection. Multiply their outputs elementwise, then project M to C.
  X["x · [B, T, C]"] --> G["Gate: C → M, then SiLU"]
  X --> U["Up: C → M"]
  G --> P["Elementwise product · [B, T, M]"]
  U --> P
  P --> D["Down: M → C · [B, T, C]"]
